flowchart TD
  A[Human Intent] --> B[Clarify + Mission Contract]
  B --> C[Capability Readiness Probes]
  C --> D[Plan + Loop-Graph + Owners]
  D --> E[PREPARED\nPlan not run]
  E --> F[Executor Starts]
  F --> G[OBSERVED\nCode running]
  G --> H[Executor Reports Complete]
  H --> I[REPORTED\nNot verified]
  I --> J[Verifier / Tests / CI / Render Gate]
  J -->|fail| K[Targeted Repair]
  K --> F
  J -->|pass| L[VERIFIED]
  L --> M[Deploy / External Action]
  M --> N[READ BACK]
  N --> O[Acceptance Criteria]
  O --> P[ACCEPTED]
  P --> Q[Memory Review + Operate]
